# Key & BPM finder — proxy to the key-scan service.
# Keep the /api prefix: :splat is only the part matched by *, so
# "/api/:splat" is required or every call lands on /key/analyze (404)
# and the tool silently falls back to the less accurate browser estimator.
/api/*  https://key-scan-service-production.up.railway.app/api/:splat  200!

# Lyric Book — proxy the Railway backend under dabzflp.com/lyric-book
# 200 rewrite keeps the address bar on our domain and makes API calls same-origin.
/lyric-book/*  https://dabzaudio-production-7fd4.up.railway.app/:splat  200!
/lyric-book    /lyric-book/  301!

# Community Hub — proxy the Railway backend under dabzflp.com/community-hub
# 200 rewrite keeps the address bar on our domain; API calls go through the proxy.
# Proxy rule MUST come first: Netlify normalizes trailing slashes, so a
# "/community-hub -> /community-hub/" redirect would also catch "/community-hub/"
# and loop. Matching the proxy first means the slashed URL is served directly.
/community-hub/*  https://community-hub-production-ee48.up.railway.app/:splat  200!
/community-hub    /community-hub/  301!
